% Safety is decided over the whole body regardless of the order it is
% written in, so the evaluator has to move a negation and a comparison
% after the literals that bind their variables.
bird(tweety).
bird(opus).
penguin(opus).

size(tweety, 1).
size(opus, 9).

flies(X) :- not penguin(X), bird(X).
small(X) :- N < 5, size(X, N).

flies(X)?
small(X)?
